   "backdrop": "#FFFFFF",
   "prompt": "Build set logging rows like Hevy's.\n- Table: full-width rows, 51.8 pt tall, content inset 17.3 pt, on #FFFFFF.\n- Columns: previous set at 8.7 pt, KG centered at 168.5 pt, REPS centered at 251.9 pt, a 25.2 pt check box at the right edge. Put SET numbers at the far left.\n- Type: Inter 17 pt with tabular figures. Previous set 500, values 700.\n- Done row: #C7FEA0 fill, values #141616, previous #7F8888, box #56BD23 with a 2 pt #FFFFFF check and 6.5 pt corners.\n- Pending row: #FFFFFF fill, last session's values as #ACB0B4 placeholders, box #E0E0E0.\n- Add Set: 358.4 x 41.7 pt, 10 pt corners, #F3F4F8, a 14 pt plus and an Inter 500 label in #131417, 17 pt under the last row.\n- States: tap the box to finish the set, fill the row lime over 200 ms and start the rest timer. Add Set appends a pending row.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
