   "why": "Each lift leads with its gap, up 16% on One Rep Max, then 2 bars, 93 kg against 80 kg, so the stronger athlete reads in one glance.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare\"><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__label\">Comparison</div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__title x-hevy-strength-compare__title--1\"><span>One Rep Max</span><svg class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 12.1 14.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.05 13.5V1.4M1.3 6.15L6.05 1.4l4.75 4.75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#33B159\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__pct\">16%</span></div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__line x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1a\"><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__avatar\">SD</span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__bar x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--a\"></span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__kg\">93 kg</span></div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__line x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1b\"><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__avatar\">JA</span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__bar x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--b\"></span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__kg\">80 kg</span></div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__title x-hevy-strength-compare__title--2\"><span>Heaviest Weight</span><svg class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__arrow\" viewBox=\"0 0 12.1 14.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.05 13.5V1.4M1.3 6.15L6.05 1.4l4.75 4.75\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#33B159\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__pct\">14%</span></div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__line x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2a\"><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__avatar\">SD</span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__bar x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--a\"></span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__kg\">82 kg</span></div><div class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__line x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2b\"><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__avatar\">JA</span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__bar x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--b\"></span><span class=\"x-hevy-strength-compare__kg\">72 kg</span></div></div>",
   "css": ".x-hevy-strength-compare{position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:391px;height:273px;border-radius:24px;background:#FFFFFF;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16.6px;font-weight:400;line-height:20px;letter-spacing:0;color:#1A1A1C;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__label{position:absolute;left:16px;top:12.07px;color:#86898E}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__title{position:absolute;left:16.4px;display:flex;align-items:center}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__arrow{display:block;width:12.1px;height:14.5px;margin:0 7.4px 0 12.9px;transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__pct{color:#33B159}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line{position:absolute;left:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;height:21px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__avatar{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex:none;width:21px;height:21px;border-radius:50%;background:#D1DAE6;color:#4A5568;font-size:8.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__bar{flex:none;height:12.5px;margin-left:10.7px;border-radius:6.25px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--a{background:#267EE8}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__bar--b{background:#E0E3E8}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__kg{margin-left:12px;color:#86898E;transform:translateY(0.25px)}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__title--1{top:52.07px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1a{top:92.1px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1a .x-hevy-strength-compare__bar{width:272.3px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1b{top:124.1px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--1b .x-hevy-strength-compare__bar{width:234.24px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__title--2{top:163.37px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2a{top:203.6px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2a .x-hevy-strength-compare__bar{width:240.09px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2b{top:235.6px}\n.x-hevy-strength-compare__line--2b .x-hevy-strength-compare__bar{width:210.81px}",
