   "backdrop": "#FFFFFF",
   "prompt": "Build strength comparison bars like Hevy's.\n- Layout: 358.5 pt wide on #FFFFFF. A Comparison label, then 1 group per lift, 111 pt apart.\n- Type: Inter 400, 16.6 pt. Label and kg values #86898E, titles #1A1A1C.\n- Title row: lift name, 12.9 pt gap, a 12.1 x 14.5 pt arrow with a 2 pt stroke, 7.4 pt gap, the percent.\n- Rows: a 21 pt initials avatar on #D1DAE6 (Inter 600, 8.5 pt, #4A5568), 10.7 pt gap, a 12.5 pt round bar, the kg value 12 pt after it. Rows 31.7 pt apart.\n- Colors: first athlete #267EE8, second #E0E3E8. A lead is #33B159 with an up arrow, a deficit #D35749 with a down arrow.\n- Data rule: bar width = kg x one shared scale; the longest bar and its label fill the row. Percent = (first minus second) / second, rounded.\n- Motion: bars grow from 0 in 400 ms, 60 ms stagger.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
