   "why": "Three counts, 56 workouts, 72 followers and 55 following, sit in one row beside an 88 pt avatar, and Follow spans the full width at 42 pt tall.",
   "html": "<div class=\"x-hevy-profile-header\"><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__avatar\">SD</span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__name\">strongdavid</span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__stat x-hevy-profile-header__stat--1\"><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__slabel\">Workouts</span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__count\">56</span></span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__stat x-hevy-profile-header__stat--2\"><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__slabel\">Followers</span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__count\">72</span></span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__stat x-hevy-profile-header__stat--3\"><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__slabel\">Following</span><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__count\">55</span></span><div class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__bio\"><svg class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__pin\" viewBox=\"0 0 8.4 15.2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><defs><radialGradient id=\"x-hevy-profile-header-pin\" cx=\"0.42\" cy=\"0.32\" r=\"0.68\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FF8A8A\"/><stop offset=\"0.45\" stop-color=\"#E5454B\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#B8232B\"/></radialGradient></defs><path d=\"M4.2 7.6V14.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8E8E93\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"4.2\" cy=\"4.15\" r=\"4.15\" fill=\"url(#x-hevy-profile-header-pin)\"/></svg><span class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__t1\">San Francisco</span><svg class=\"x-hevy-profile-header__arm\" viewBox=\"0 0 14.6 16.3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.2 1C3.5 0.2 6.2 0 7.4 0.6C8 1.4 7.9 2.8 7.4 3.5C6.6 4.4 5.4 4.8 4.8 5.3L4.3 11C5 9.7 7.6 8.4 10.2 8.5C12.8 8.6 14.6 10.2 14.5 12.2C14.4 14 12.8 15.2 10.4 15.6C7.4 16.1 3.2 16.3 1.2 15.9C0.3 15.7 0 15 0.1 14C0.3 11.2 1 7.8 1.8 5C1.4 3.6 1.4 2 2.2 1Z\" fill=\"#F6B52C\" stroke=\"#E29A17\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"/><path d=\"M3.3 2.6C4.2 2.3 5.3 2.4 6.1 2.9M4.6 11.6C5.6 10.9 6.6 10.6 7.6 10.6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E29A17\" stroke-width=\"0.55\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span class=\"x-hevy-profile