   "prompt": "Build a profile stats header like Hevy's.\n- Layout: 360 x 186 pt on #FFFFFF.\n- Avatar: 88.2 pt circle in #D0DBE7 with initials in Inter 600, 32 pt, #3F4B5C.\n- Text column: 17.2 pt right of the avatar. Username in Inter 700, 18.6 pt, #1A1A1C, baseline 24 pt.\n- Stats: 3 columns on an 84.6 pt pitch. Labels Inter 400, 13.5 pt, #8A8C91; counts Inter 400, 16.7 pt, #1A1A1C, baselines 25 pt apart.\n- Bio: Inter 400, 16.7 pt, #1A1A1C, baseline 122.6 pt, with 16 pt SVG icons: a red pin and a yellow flexed arm.\n- Follow: full width, 41.9 pt tall, 10 pt corners, #267EE8, label Inter 500, 16.5 pt, #FFFFFF, top at 144 pt.\n- States: pressed opacity 0.85. After the tap, show Following on #EEF0F3 with a #1A1A1C label at the same size. Each stat opens its list; long names end with an ellipsis.\nSwap in my brand colors and font; keep the sizes."
